[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0016","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-29201","title":"JumpServer后台管理功能Ansible远程代码执行漏洞","description":"JumpServer 是一款开源堡垒机及运维安全审计系统，其 Ansible 模块存在输入验证绕过漏洞（CWE-94）。攻击者可在后台通过构造特制的 Ansible Playbook 模板，利用 Jinja2 模板注入执行任意代码，从而在 Celery 容器中实现远程代码执行。由于 Celery 容器以 root 权限运行且可访问数据库，攻击者可窃取所有受管主机的敏感信息或篡改数据库数据。该漏洞影响 JumpServer 3.0.0 至 3.10.6 版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。官方已在 v3.10.7 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-29201"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-29T15:15:11.963","updated":"2026-06-17T07:22:37.080","remediation":"升级 JumpServer 至 v3.10.7 或更高版本；若无法立即升级，可在后台临时禁用 Ansible 模块相关功能并限制可访问后台管理界面的来源 IP，避免未授权用户进入后台构造恶意 Playbook 模板。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/jumpserver/jumpserver/security/advisories/GHSA-pjpp-cm9x-6rwj","https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/diving-into-jumpserver-attackers-gateway-to-internal-networks-2-2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-29201.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/JumpServer%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2024-29201&CVE-2024-29202.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a23c9152c0ce51f4625e88e1e6abe715ca2d7579/cves/2024/29xxx/CVE-2024-29201.json","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/JumpServer/JumpServer(CVE-2024-29201)%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E&(CVE-2024-29202)Jinin2%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2024-29201and29202%EF%BC%9AJumpServer%20%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%20RCE%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/50da10c5575a94200ba135d17613df27d01f9b8c/2024/CVE-2024-29201.json","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/f62012ff68e6011291b2851d1c7ccdb8a587c013/2024-03/Jumpserver%3C3.10.7%20Ansible%20Playbook%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-29201).md","https://github.com/J1ezds/Vulnerability-Wiki-page/blob/e5e61ef3b30d6c854a6eef982e1ccae251304086/webapp/JumpServer-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-CVE-2024-29201&CVE-2024-29202.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-29201"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0004","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-27091","title":"GeoNode 存储型跨站脚本致账户接管漏洞","description":"GeoNode 是一款地理空间内容管理系统，其富文本编辑器存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过在富文本内容中注入恶意脚本，当管理员或用户查看该内容时脚本自动执行。由于 Cookie 设置了 Secure 标记无法直接窃取，但攻击者可利用该漏洞获取受害者的 CSRF Token，进而伪造请求修改目标用户的邮箱地址，最终实现完全接管账户。该漏洞影响 GeoNode 4.2.3 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-27091","GHSA-rwcv-whm8-fmxm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2024-03-27T13:15:47.023","updated":"2026-06-17T07:19:08.667","remediation":"立即将 GeoNode 升级至 4.2.3 或以上版本，该版本已修复富文本编辑器存储型 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面对用户输入内容（尤其是富文本字段）实施 HTML 标签与 JavaScript 事件过滤，并启用 Content-Security-Policy 标头限制脚本执行来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/GeoNode/geonode/commit/e53bdeff331f4b577918927d60477d4b50cca02f","https://github.com/GeoNode/geonode/security/advisories/GHSA-rwcv-whm8-fmxm"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0004.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0004.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0018","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-29272","title":"VvvebJs 页面编辑器 任意文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"VvvebJs 是一款基于 JavaScript 的开源页面编辑器组件，广泛用于前端可视化建站。该漏洞源于其文件上传功能未对用户提交的文件类型、扩展名及内容进行充分的校验与过滤，攻击者可在未授权或低权限状态下，将包含恶意代码的脚本文件（如 PHP/JS）上传至服务器可解析的目录下。一旦上传成功，攻击者即可通过直接访问该文件在目标服务器上执行任意代码，从而完全控制受影响主机，造成远程代码执行（RCE）。攻击条件为存在暴露的文件上传接口且目标部署环境允许上传文件被解析执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-29272"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-22T04:15:11.663","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 VvvebJs 至修复版本（官方已在 commit c6422cfd4d835c2fa6d512645e30015f24538ef0 中修复），并在上传接口增加白名单扩展名校验、文件内容类型检测与目录执行权限隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/givanz/VvvebJs/commit/c6422cfd4d835c2fa6d512645e30015f24538ef0","https://github.com/givanz/VvvebJs/issues/343","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-29272.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a6cbad21a8ff006125b5e5b00f9ab42bd00eac7c/2024/CVE-2024-29272.json","https://github.com/awjkjflkwlekfdjs/CVE-2024-29272","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-29272"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0018.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0018.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0011","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-2014","title":"北京派网软件有限公司 Panabit Panalog 大数据日志审计系统 sprog_upstatus.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"北京派网软件有限公司Panabit-Panalog大数据日志审计系统sprog_upstatus.php文件存在严重SQL注入漏洞。攻击者可远程向'id'参数注入恶意SQL语句（如：1 and updatexml(1,concat(0x7e,user()),0)），实现数据泄露、篡改或直接控制数据库。该漏洞影响Windows/Linux平台上部署的Panabit-Panalog审计系统，CVSS评分7.3（HIGH），威胁等级极高。攻击条件较低，无需身份验证即可触发，一旦被披露可被攻击者广泛利用。主要影响范围包括日志审计系统的访问控制、权限管理及审计数据完整性，可能导致严重的安全事件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-2014"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-21T02:52:26.287","updated":"2026-06-17T07:23:33.743","remediation":"立即对 /Maintain/sprog_upstatus.php 的 id 参数实施严格的输入过滤和参数化查询，禁止拼接 SQL 语句；部署 WAF 规则拦截含 updatexml、union、sleep 等 SQL 注入特征的请求；限制后台管理页面仅允许内网 IP 访问；如无法修复代码，建议暂时下线该接口或升级到 Panabit 官方后续发布的安全版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mashroompc0527/CVE/blob/main/vul.md","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.255268","https://vuldb.com/?id.255268","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-2014.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/2xxx/CVE-2024-2014.json","https://github.com/onewinner/Lightx/blob/66baef13ea408675c6c144ae6e01b1df0a9278eb/config/pocs/CVE-2024-2014.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bd8147c9eb98061a73ac3211bfcd9edfb4e5605b/2024/2xxx/CVE-2024-2014.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2024/03/GHSA-2c52-g67x-6vf3/GHSA-2c52-g67x-6vf3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-2014.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/760f2a0ac5ec983dd84c5e09cb5339a52f81c82b/docs/2024/%E6%B4%BE%E7%BD%91_%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%B4%BE%E7%BD%91%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8panabit-panalog%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A1%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9Fsprog_upstatus-php%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2024-2014.toml","https://github.com/damn77789/nuclei-pocs/blob/81fb60243f8c8e930e9c4f1b65e2110e6e5a9204/folder-3/CVE-2024-2014.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-20148.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2024-20146","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-2014"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0022","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-20767","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 访问控制不当导致任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 存在访问控制不当漏洞（CVE-2024-20767，对应 APSB24-14）。受影响版本包括 ColdFusion 2023.6、2021.12 及更早版本。攻击者可利用此漏洞访问或修改受限制的文件系统，绕过访问控制机制实现任意文件读取或写入。攻击者无需用户交互即可实施攻击，但要求目标系统上部署的 ColdFusion 管理面板可通过互联网访问。该漏洞严重威胁企业系统数据安全，可能导致敏感信息泄露和系统安全破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-20767"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-18","updated":"2026-07-17","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Adobe 发布的安全更新版本：ColdFusion 2023 Update 7（2023.7）或 ColdFusion 2021 Update 13（2021.13），通过管理控制台「服务器更新」安装 APSB24-14 补丁。如无法立即升级，应通过防火墙限制对 /CFIDE/ 及管理控制台的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的管理员 API 接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/coldfusion/apsb24-14.html","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-20767","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2024-20767"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-20767.yaml","https://github.com/ATonysan/poc-exp/blob/main/AdobeColdFusion_CVE-2024-20767_ArbitraryFileRead.py"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0290","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0290.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"甄云SRM云平台SpEL表达式注入漏洞","description":"甄云SRM云平台存在SpEL表达式注入漏洞，攻击者可在未经身份认证的情况下，通过向/oauth/public/路径中注入恶意的SpEL表达式，利用GroovyClassLoader动态加载并执行任意恶意代码，进而远程控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响范围广泛，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-03b6acda","XVE-2024-18301"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-01","updated":"2024-06-01","remediation":"厂商暂未发布官方补丁，建议部署WAF拦截SpEL表达式特征，限制/oauth/public/路径的访问权限，避免将SRM云平台直接暴露在公网。同时可配置安全过滤器对用户输入中的SpEL表达式进行过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T09:53:22.045047172+00:00","references":["https://github.com/MarkBMoss/POC-Collection"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0089","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-0089","title":"亿赛通电子文档安全管理系统 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"亿赛通电子文档安全管理系统（CDGServer3）在处理 CDGAuthoriseTempletService1 接口的请求时，未能对用户输入的 SQL 语句进行充分过滤与参数化处理，攻击者可构造恶意的 POST 请求向后台数据库注入任意 SQL 指令，进而读取、篡改敏感文档元数据或绕过身份认证，导致权限越权与数据泄露。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-0089"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2024-03-01","updated":"2024-06-01","remediation":"升级亿赛通电子文档安全管理系统至官方已修复的安全版本，并在 CDGServer3 服务接口层对 CDGAuthoriseTempletService1 的输入参数实施预编译（参数化查询）与严格的白名单校验，同时限制该接口的匿名访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cdgserver.com/","https://nvd.nist.gov/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0003","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-24525","title":"Epoint EpointWebBuilder 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EpointWebBuilder 存在代码注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 URL 中的 infoid 参数注入恶意代码，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 5.1.0-sp1、5.2.1-sp1、5.4.1 和 5.4.2 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，建议用户及时升级修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-24525"],"sources":["search"],"published":"2024-02-29T06:15:47.427","updated":"2026-06-17T07:14:34.463","remediation":"立即联系泛微官方获取 E-WebBuilder 最新安全补丁，将系统升级至修复版本（不低于 5.4.3）。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层对 URL 中 infoid 参数实施严格的输入白名单校验，禁止传入特殊字符、系统命令及代码执行关键字，并限制后台管理地址的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://l3v3lforall.github.io/EpointWebBuilder_v5.x_VULN/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0495","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-26327","title":"QEMU PCIe SR-IOV Virtual Function 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"QEMU 的 PCIe SR-IOV 虚拟功能（VF）实现中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，位于 hw/pci/pcie_sriov.c 的 register_vfs 函数。当虚拟机内客户机操作系统写入的 NumVFs 值超过 TotalVFs 上限时，QEMU 未能正确校验该边界条件，导致 VF 实现中发生堆缓冲区溢出（CWE-122/CWE-787）。攻击者可通过在客户机中构造恶意 PCI 配置空间写入操作触发此漏洞，造成宿主机 QEMU 进程崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 QEMU 7.1.0 至 10.0.3 版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-26327"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-02-19T05:15:22.527","updated":"2026-06-17T07:17:36.877","remediation":"将 QEMU 升级至 9.0.0 或更高版本（上游提交 6081b4243cd64dff1b2cf5b0c215c71e9d7e753b）；RHEL 9 用户安装 RHSA-2024:9136 提供的 qemu-kvm-9.0.0-10.el9_5 或更新版本；Debian/Ubuntu 用户通过包管理器更新至发行版提供的修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在虚拟机配置中禁用 PCIe SR-IOV 功能（-device pcie-root-port,disable-sriov=on）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lore.kernel.org/all/20240214-reuse-v4-5-89ad093a07f4%40daynix.com/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20240419-0010/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-26327.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/26xxx/CVE-2024-26327.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/qemu/CVE-2024-26327.patch","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/d30a475530366858ce5fbe93bf9aa03ac85ed76b/2024-02/QEMU%20Virtual%20Function%20%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-26327).md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-26327.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-26327","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2024/26xxx/CVE-2024-26327.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-26327.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-26327.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2025/07/GHSA-399m-rf4f-w5x4/GHSA-399m-rf4f-w5x4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0164","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-0164","title":"Dell Unity svc_topstats 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Dell Unity 5.4之前版本中的svc_topstats工具存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。经过身份验证的攻击者可利用此漏洞以提升的权限执行任意命令，导致系统完全受控。攻击者需要本地访问权限，但无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-0164","HWPOC-2024-023e93a2"],"sources":["cve","hwpoc"],"published":"2024-02-12","updated":"2024-08-12","remediation":"升级Dell Unity至5.4或更高版本，参考DSA-2024-042安全公告中的补丁说明进行修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-08-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.dell.com/support/kbdoc/en-us/000222010/dsa-2024-042-dell-unity-dell-unity-vsa-and-dell-unity-xt-security-update-for-multiple-vulnerabilities"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0015","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-23334","title":"Python aiohttp 目录遍历漏洞","description":"aiohttp 是一个基于 asyncio 的 Python 异步 HTTP 客户端/服务器框架。当以 Web 服务器模式运行并配置静态路由时，若将 `follow_symlinks` 选项设置为 True，系统未对读取文件是否位于静态根目录内进行校验，导致攻击者可通过向目标发送包含 `../` 路径遍历序列的恶意 HTTP 请求（如 `GET /static/../../../../../../etc/passwd`）绕过目录限制，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 aiohttpp < 3.9.2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。建议升级至 3.9.2 或更高版本，或禁用 follow_symlinks 并配置反向代理以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-23334"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-01-29T23:15:08.563","updated":"2026-06-17T07:12:37.090","remediation":"升级 aiohttp 至 3.9.2 或更高版本；如无法升级，在配置静态路由时将 `follow_symlinks` 设为 `False`，并在前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx）拦截包含 `../` 的路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/1c335944d6a8b1298baf179b7c0b3069f10c514b","https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/pull/8079","https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/security/advisories/GHSA-5h86-8mv2-jq9f","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/ICUOCFGTB25WUT336BZ4UNYLSZOUVKBD/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/XXWVZIVAYWEBHNRIILZVB3R3SDQNNAA7/","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00002.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52474","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-23334.yaml","https://github.com/BestDevOfc/CVE-2024-23334-PoC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-23334.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/ae581d9cabe832052203eb28ab4690fd73c494cf/python/CVE-2024-23334/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a6cbad21a8ff006125b5e5b00f9ab42bd00eac7c/2024/CVE-2024-23334.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Python%20aiohttp%20%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2024-23334.md","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/aiohttp/aiohttp%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-23334).md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9f792687ed156d63344016f8bf658946079fb494/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2024/CVE-2024-23334.yaml","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/ComfyUI_follow_symlinks_File_Read_Vulnerability_(CVE-2024-23334).md","https://github.com/ATonysan/poc-exp/blob/7ba7f2a08999ace95cc4ab2076c239e10f385dc6/aiothhp_CVE-2024-23334_DirectoryTraversal.py","https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/df2272c562a7cbf407e405df9c6c82b356a533b9/providers/dbt/cloud/docs/changelog.rst","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/133a0d586d237a236f33d20e243ad929fcf9e0a4/data/2024/CVE-2024-23334-ox1111_CVE-2024-23334.md","https://github.com/jhonnybonny/CVE-2024-23334","https://github.com/z3rObyte/CVE-2024-23334-PoC","https://github.com/ox1111/CVE-2024-23334","https://github.com/wizarddos/CVE-2024-23334","https://github.com/s4botai/CVE-2024-23334-PoC","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-23334"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0014","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-21733","title":"Apache Tomcat 错误信息敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（CWE-209），当服务器在处理 HTTP 请求时发生错误，Tomcat 会返回包含详细异常信息的错误页面。攻击者可通过发送特制的畸形请求或利用请求走私技术，触发服务器返回包含内部路径、堆栈跟踪、配置参数等敏感信息的错误响应。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 8.5.7 至 8.5.63 及 9.0.0-M11 至 9.0.43 版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用。成功利用后，攻击者可获取系统内部结构信息，为进一步攻击提供情报支持。建议用户升级至 8.5.64 或 9.0.44 及更高版本进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-21733"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-01-19T11:15:08.043","updated":"2026-06-17T07:10:02.277","remediation":"建议立即将 Apache Tomcat 升级至 8.5.64 及以上版本或 9.0.44 及以上版本，新版本已修复错误响应中泄露敏感信息的问题。如暂无法升级，可在前端反向代理（如 Nginx/Apache HTTPD）层面对后端 Tomcat 的响应进行拦截与重写，隐藏包含堆栈或内部路径的错误信息，并关闭不必要的默认错误页面作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/h9bjqdd0odj6lhs2o96qgowcc6hb0cfz","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/176951/Apache-Tomcat-8.5.63-9.0.43-HTTP-Response-Smuggling.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/01/19/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00009.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20240216-0005/","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/f62012ff68e6011291b2851d1c7ccdb8a587c013/2024-01/Apache%20Tomcat%20%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-21733).md","https://github.com/LtmThink/CVE-2024-21733","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-21733"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0014.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0014.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0200","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-0200","title":"GitHub Enterprise Server 不安全反射远程代码执行漏洞","description":"GitHub Enterprise Server（GHES）存在不安全反射漏洞（CWE-470），攻击者可通过反射注入调用用户可控的方法，进而导致远程代码执行。利用该漏洞需要攻击者已登录 GHES 实例且拥有组织所有者（organization owner）角色。该漏洞影响 3.12 之前的所有 GitHub Enterprise Server 版本，可造成机密性、完整性和可用性的完全破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-0200","HWPOC-2024-02a6ce9e"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2024-01-16","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"升级 GitHub Enterprise Server 至已修复版本 3.8.13、3.9.8、3.10.5 或 3.11.3 及以上；同时严格控制并审查具备组织所有者角色的账号权限，遵循最小权限原则以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-0200","https://docs.github.com/en/[email protected]/admin/release-notes#3.8.13","https://docs.github.com/en/[email protected]/admin/release-notes#3.9.8","https://docs.github.com/en/[email protected]/admin/release-notes#3.10.5","https://docs.github.com/en/[email protected]/admin/release-notes#3.11.3"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0350","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0350.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Array Networks SSL VPN 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Array Networks SSL VPN 网关存在路径遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过构造带有 X_AN_FILESHARE 头的特制 HTTP 请求，利用 fshare_template 参数中的目录穿越序列读取服务器上的任意文件，包括 /etc/passwd 等敏感系统文件，可能导致系统凭证泄露及内网横向移动风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-047addb8"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-01-15","updated":"2026-07-19","remediation":"升级 Array SSL-VPN 网关至 9.4.0.481 之后的安全版本，限制 VPN 管理接口仅允许可信 IP 访问，并监控异常的文件共享请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T02:03:28.059239121+00:00","references":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pupulit/POC/main/Array%20VPN/Array%20VPN%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0299","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-0299","title":"Totolink N200RE setTracerouteCfg OS命令注入漏洞","description":"Totolink N200RE路由器固件版本9.3.5u.6139_B20201216中/cgi-bin/cstecgi.cgi的setTracerouteCfg函数存在OS命令注入漏洞。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程发送特制请求，通过command参数注入任意系统命令，导致设备被完全控制。该漏洞利用代码已公开。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-0299"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2024-01-08","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"厂商Totolink未发布官方补丁。建议用户将受影响的N200RE路由器更换为其他受支持型号，或禁用远程管理功能，并在网络边界设置访问控制规则限制对/cgi-bin/cstecgi.cgi的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-0299","https://github.com/jylsec/vuldb/blob/main/TOTOLINK/N200RE/setTracerouteCfg/README.md","https://vuldb.com/?id.249865"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/jylsec/vuldb/blob/main/TOTOLINK/N200RE/setTracerouteCfg/README.md"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0299.toml"}]